WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.490
- Calls are mounting for the resignation

00:00:01.490 --> 00:00:02.930
and potential impeachment

00:00:02.930 --> 00:00:06.030
of the South Dakota Attorney
General Jason Ravnsborg,

00:00:06.030 --> 00:00:08.420
after he struck and
killed a man with his car.

00:00:08.420 --> 00:00:11.240
This is an absolutely bonkers legal case

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:14.720
where last year, Ravnsborg
admitted to striking a man

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:15.553
with his car.

00:00:15.553 --> 00:00:17.080
He said he was doing nothing wrong,

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:18.440
and it was just one of
those freak accidents.

00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:20.920
But the evidence seems to show
that the victim actually flew

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:22.742
through the man's windshield,
leaving his eyeglasses

00:00:22.742 --> 00:00:25.930
inside the interior of the car.

00:00:25.930 --> 00:00:27.670
Then Ravnsborg went back the next day

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:29.980
and found that the man had passed away.

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:31.280
Ravnsborg claims that he wasn't drinking

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:32.450
and was paying attention.

00:00:32.450 --> 00:00:33.720
But "The Daily Beast" reports

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:35.450
that it seems that based
on the internet traffic

00:00:35.450 --> 00:00:36.283
of his phone,

00:00:36.283 --> 00:00:38.180
Ravnsborg was actually
reading conspiracy theories

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:40.160
about Joe Biden at the
time that he was driving,

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:41.630
and struck and killed the man.

00:00:41.630 --> 00:00:43.520
This is an absolutely
bonkers investigation.

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:45.280
And it's clear why people are
calling for his resignation

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:47.690
or impeachment from the
top law enforcement job.

00:00:47.690 --> 00:00:49.590
So we may see him in court just like

00:00:49.590 --> 00:00:51.793
we'll see you in court
if you don't subscribe.

